    "RFC7911-3-1": {
      "note": "Sentence: NLRI encoding MUST be extended by prepending the four-octet Path Identifier field. Forbidden: no field, a field of other size, or the field placed after the prefix. TestWriteNLRI_WithStoredPathID asserts buf[0..3]==0000002a and n==4+Len() (red if absent, mis-sized, or appended, since buf[0] would then be the prefix length); TestWriteNLRI_AddPath disabled subtest asserts n==Len() without ADD-PATH; TestINETWithAddPath decodes 00000001 then 8,10 as id 1 and 10.0.0.0/8; test/plugin/adj-rib-in-replay-addpath-source.ci asserts exact wire hex 00000000180A0000 vs 180A0000 per destination negotiation.",
